sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as Alert (CEMS RSS / Montandon)
    participant ORC as Orchestrator
    participant COR as Correlation (D2.1)
    participant K8S as K8s job and notebook
    participant GO as IFRC GO
    SRC->>ORC: new event
    ORC->>COR: correlate EO layer to event data
    COR-->>ORC: assembled data context
    ORC->>K8S: run notebooks per analysis matrix
    K8S->>K8S: footprint intersect exposure
    K8S->>GO: publish artifacts (HTML / PDF / maps)
